{"_meta":{"securitySchemes":[{"scopes":["people_table:read"],"type":"oauth2"},{"scopes":["people_table:write"],"type":"oauth2"}]},"description":"Manage a job\u2019s People table columns: action=list returns every column for this key with its exposure, capabilities and version (people_table.columns.list); action=create adds a custom column of any of the 15 types (people_table.columns.create); action=update renames one (people_table.columns.update); action=archive previews the impact with dryRun=true and archives with confirm=true (people_table.columns.archive). Only custom columns are editable (custom:<fieldId>); built-in and system columns answer COLUMN_NOT_EDITABLE. Writes go through the web\u2019s own column and cell rules, at expectedVersion (a stale version is VERSION_MISMATCH), and every audit event records an agent actor and the request\u2019s batchId. Writes spend the key\u2019s write budget (60 requests a minute and 10,000 edits an hour across jobs and surfaces; a dryRun counts as a read). Requires people_table:write, except columns action=list (people_table:read).","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"action":{"enum":["list","create","update","archive"],"type":"string"},"columnId":{"description":"update, archive: the column to change.","pattern":"^(?:[a-z][a-z0-9_]{0,63}|custom:[A-Za-z0-9_-]{1,64})$","type":"string"},"confirm":{"description":"archive: archive the column.","type":"boolean"},"dryRun":{"description":"archive: preview the impact; nothing is written.","type":"boolean"},"expectedVersion":{"description":"update, archive: the column version from describe or list.","exclusiveMinimum":0,"type":"integer"},"idempotencyKey":{"description":"Required for every write except a dryRun. Same key + same input replays the original outcome; same key + changed input is a 409.","pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9._:-]{8,128}$","type":"string"},"jobId":{"maxLength":